config WATCHDOG_SOFTWARE
    bool "Software task watchdog"
    help
      Monitor explicitly registered task heartbeat deadlines independently
      of the external watchdog. Report timeouts through a caller callback.

config WATCHDOG_EXTERNAL
    bool "External GPIO watchdog"
    depends on GPIO
    help
      Initialize the app,gpio-watchdog devicetree GPIO when the application
      explicitly calls watchdog_init(), then periodically toggle it.
      When disabled,
      leave the GPIO untouched and do not start the feed timer.

config WATCHDOG_CHECK_INTERVAL_MS
    int "Task watchdog check interval in milliseconds"
    depends on WATCHDOG_SOFTWARE
    default 100
    range 1 60000
    help
      Run task checks on the system workqueue at this interval. Only completed,
      successful checks renew health. Results and startup grace remain valid
      for exactly three times this interval.
